ART AVENUE - CUSHION CONFIGURATOR SCHEMA TEMPLATES
===================================================
Reference file (not rendered). Copy the matching JSON into a cushion's
product metafield: Metafields > "Configurator schema" (aav.configurator).

HOW CUSHIONS USE THE GRID ENGINE
--------------------------------
- Two priced axes: Size (option "Size") x Fill (option "Fill").
- Size values are cm-first with inch equivalent, e.g.  45 x 45 cm / 18"
- Fill values: "Cover Only" / "With Insert". Price lives on the variant.
- "no_pickers": true  -> suppresses the legacy sofa Colour row entirely.
  IMPORTANT: never use "pickers": []  -- an empty array reads as blank in
  Liquid and the engine falls back to the sofa path. Always the boolean flag.
- No unit_map and no aav.size_dimensions -> the dims box auto-hides; the
  size buttons themselves communicate dimensions.
- material_notes shows a one-line note under the Fill buttons per value.
- All variants: inventoryPolicy CONTINUE (made-to-order).

----------------------------------------------------
TEMPLATE CU-SQ - Square cushion, fixed design (Tokyo type)
Variants: Size (45/50/60 cm, subset allowed) x Fill = up to 8
----------------------------------------------------
{"engine":"grid","size_option":"Size","material_option":"Fill","size_label":"Size","material_label":"Fill","no_pickers":true,"custom_size_text":"Want a custom size or a different fabric?","material_notes":{"Cover Only":"Cover only - insert not included. Pairs with a standard insert in the matching size.","With Insert":"Arrives ready to style, with a plush hypoallergenic fibre insert included."}}

----------------------------------------------------
TEMPLATE CU-RECT - Rectangular / lumbar cushion, fixed design
Variants: Size (30 x 50 / 40 x 60 / 35 x 85 cm) x Fill = 6
Extend sizes later via productVariantsBulkCreate.
----------------------------------------------------
Same JSON as CU-SQ. Only the Size option values differ on the product.

----------------------------------------------------
TEMPLATE CU-SHAPED - Shaped cushion, One Size, insert always included
Variants: exactly 1 (Size = "One Size", Fill = "With Insert")
Size button and Fill buttons collapse to fixed lines automatically.
----------------------------------------------------
{"engine":"grid","size_option":"Size","material_option":"Fill","size_label":"Size","material_label":"Fill","no_pickers":true,"custom_size_text":"Want this shape in a different fabric?","material_notes":{"With Insert":"Arrives ready to style, with a shaped insert included."}}

----------------------------------------------------
COLOURWAY VARIANT (any template above)
For designs offered in multiple non-priced colourways:
1. Remove "no_pickers" and add a pickers[] entry instead.
2. Seed aav.swatches on the product with metaobjects whose category matches.
----------------------------------------------------
{"engine":"grid","size_option":"Size","material_option":"Fill","size_label":"Size","material_label":"Fill","custom_size_text":"Want a custom size or a different fabric?","material_notes":{"Cover Only":"Cover only - insert not included.","With Insert":"Arrives ready to style, insert included."},"pickers":[{"key":"colourway","label":"Colourway","property":"Colourway","category":"<Design> Colourways","branch_by_axis":false,"order_swatch":true}]}

Notes:
- branch_by_axis:false = always-on picker filtered by its own category.
- order_swatch:true keeps the "Order a swatch" action (textiles: shown).
- Category naming convention: "<Design name> Colourways", one set per design.
